From 400aacd738406c69bdabefe60dff91f1b959719e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:25:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD review-done confirmation flow so completed patch
 chats close deliberately

A clean review is not the same as user acceptance of the feature as finished. The controller appends a yes/no prompt to the reviewed patch chat and selects it; answering yes hides the chat, while later follow-up text reopens the same session so command-surface typing continues the patch conversation.
